      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(item => {\n  const d = item.json;\n  const feedbackText = d.feedbackText ?? d.feedback ?? d.employee_feedback ?? '';\n\n  const prompt = `Analyze this employee feedback in Indonesian: \"${feedbackText}\"\n\nTasks:\n1. Determine sentiment: POSITIVE, NEUTRAL, or NEGATIVE.\n2. Categorize the issue: Facilities, Management, Salary, or Workload.\n3. Suggest a quick action (maximum 5 words).\n\nYou are a Senior HR Specialist. Be objective and base the analysis only on the employee feedback.\nReturn only valid structured output.`;\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...d,\n      feedbackText,\n      prompt\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
